  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Emergency Appeal 2026 for Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to sustain lifesaving health services in Yemen by supporting four primary health centres in Aden, ensuring continued access to consultations, maternal care, and safe deliveries despite funding challenges. It also strengthens two hospitals in Ad Dale&#x2019; and Hadhramaut through medical equipment, minor rehabilitation, and solar power systems to restore critical services, particularly emergency obstetric and neonatal care, while improving sustainability.
In addition, the project enhances WASH services across targeted facilities by upgrading water systems, sanitation, and waste management. This ensures vulnerable populations have improved access to safe water and adequate hygiene services alongside essential health and nutrition care.</narrative>
  </description>
